// The boat SDK's checks (GitHub #13474, stage 1), run against a fake: every
// answer below is a whole HTTP response the client reads as if curl had
// printed it, and nothing is sent. Loaded by boat.coax with #test.
//   coax/bin/coax test --library coax/lib/boat/boat.coax
//
// Where the fixtures come from. GET_404, UNAUTHORIZED, MACHINE_NOT_RUNNING,
// SSH_ARCHIVED and SAVE_LIMIT are boat's own bodies, ported from the old Rust
// SDK's redacted captures (git show 853417f290:crates/boat/fixtures/observed/),
// and RATE is one with its details trimmed. The rest follow boat's OpenAPI
// file (docs.boat.dev/openapi/boat-v1.yaml, 2026-11-13) with the stage 0
// values (docs/cloud/boat-devbox.md): box bx_fwh3xnws, large, the template
// oa-devbox-20261113, the box_20 plan. IPs are documentation addresses; no
// key or token appears here.

